**Title:** Whispers of the Coastal Night: A Soothing Journey with Alex and Nori

**Description:** In tonight's serene episode, join Alex, an eleven-year-old with a gentle spirit, as they wander the tranquil shores of a coastal landscape with their lively otter companion, Nori. Under the golden hues of the setting sun, Alex embarks on a journey of patience and acceptance, discovering the soothing rhythm of the ocean's lullaby and the quiet wonder of life in miniature tidal pools. This poetic tale, narrated in a calming voice, is designed to gently ease listeners into a peaceful slumber, helping to reduce anxiety and foster a deep sense of emotional calm. Allow the whispers of the waves and the embrace of the stars to guide you into a night of restful sleep.

